%% DERIVED narrative — safety-event fan-out to parent notify + admin investigation lanes.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SafetyService
    participant SQS
    participant NotificationService
    participant SafetyInvestigationService
    participant AdminConsole
    participant ParentApp
    participant FCM
    participant SES

    SafetyService->>SafetyService: output filter trips on high-severity block (sys-05)
    par notify parent lane
        SafetyService->>SQS: SendMessage tbot-notifications (type,safety_alert)
        alt sqs_publish_failed
            SQS--xSafetyService: 5xx — local retry
        else queued
            SQS->>NotificationService: pipeline (sys-10 sqs-worker-pipeline)
            NotificationService->>FCM: push to ParentApp (sys-10)
            NotificationService->>SES: email (if push fails or preferences)
            FCM-->>ParentApp: notification
        end
        Note over NotificationService,SES: parent_unreachable_dlq — terminal failure after 5 retries.
    and investigate lane
        SafetyService->>SQS: SendMessage tbot-safety-events (severity, transcript_ref)
        SQS->>SafetyInvestigationService: dequeue and assign reviewer
        alt investigation_assignment_skipped
            SafetyInvestigationService-->>SQS: no reviewer available — re-queue with delay
        else assigned
            SafetyInvestigationService->>AdminConsole: surface in queue (sys-12)
            AdminConsole-->>SafetyInvestigationService: reviewer opens — see sys-12 safety-investigation-w2
        end
    end
